:e
@tailrec fun f(x) =
  g(x)
fun g(x) = f(x); f(x)
//│ ╔══[COMPILATION ERROR] This function is not tail recursive.
//│ ║  l.20: 	@tailrec fun f(x) =
//│ ║        	             ^
